          "filename": "KL Ekspres (7904695210).jpg",
          "caption": "At the KLIA main terminal, after immigration (it was bloody crowded with a large arriving group from Indonesia) and after collecting your baggage, you can take this KL Ekspres (another of those quaint Malay spellings!) into downtown. At RM 35, the ride isn't exactly cheap, but the train gets you into downtown in 28min flat, not bad for a 70 odd km journey. Apparently, wi fi is available on the train, which I did not realize until I returned to Dubai. Jan/ Feb. 2012.",
